# Accepted vulnerability findings. Each entry needs a reason and an expiry date; after that date the security check fails
# again and the decision must be reviewed. See docs/operations/CI_CD_PIPELINE.md.

# Spring Framework XsltView remote code execution. Fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4). The API does not
# use XsltView or any XSLT views; it serves JSON, PDF and DOCX only. Accepted 2026-10-07.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

# Spring Framework Server-Sent Events stream corruption with view rendering. Fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring
# Boot 4); 6.2.19 is the latest 6.2 release. The API sends no Server-Sent Events and renders no views (no SseEmitter,
# ResponseBodyEmitter or ModelAndView). Accepted 2026-10-15.
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2027-01-31
